  "statement": "Points $A(1,0,0)$, $B(0,1,0)$, $C(0,0,1)$. (i) Find $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ and $\\overrightarrow{AC}$. (ii) Find the area of triangle $ABC$. (iii) Find the equation of the plane through $A,B,C$.",
  "solution": "(i) $\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-1,1,0)$, $\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-1,0,1)$. (ii) $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=(1,1,1)$; area $=\\frac12|\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}|=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$. (iii) Normal $(1,1,1)$ through $A(1,0,0)$: $(x-1)+y+z=0$, i.e. $x+y+z=1$.",
